      "text": "In order to comply with the provisions of law recently adopted under Chapter 287, Laws of 1965 which provide for reimbursement by the State of New York for medical care services rendered to patients who are medically indigent, and in order to eliminate the possibility of duplication of effort, the following action is ordered effective immediately:",
